<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-DOSEDEL WINS AMSTERDAM OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DOSEDEL WINS AMSTERDAM OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the Amsterdam Open men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding): Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) beat 1-Carlos Moya (Spain) 7-6 (7-4) 7-6 (7-5) 6-7 (4-7) 6-2.</p>
</text>
